Audited the Settings screen's Hub connection section and found one real inconsistency: the per-hub status pill duplicated the accessibility label's ternary logic but used a hardcoded `"…"` instead of the translated loading string, so sighted and screen-reader users saw different text for the same "still probing" state. Fixed by reusing the already-computed `health` variable (`mobile/app/settings.tsx`), no new i18n keys, verified with `tsc --noEmit` (only pre-existing, unrelated errors from missing `node_modules`). RESULT written to `tasks/admin-queue/done/142-settings-hub-section-pass2-RESULT.md`, marked COMPLETE.
